#: checks.py:93
msgid "Audit missing"
msgstr "Audit fehlt"

#: checks.py:94
msgid "The character has no corptools Character Audit."
msgstr "Der Character hat kein corptools-Character-Audit."

#: checks.py:95
msgid "The player adds this character in the corptools Character Audit."
msgstr "Der Spieler fügt diesen Character im corptools-Character-Audit hinzu."

#: checks.py:97
msgid ""
"The player ticks Character Audit in CharLink and logs in with this "
"character."
msgstr ""
"Der Spieler setzt in CharLink den Haken bei Character Audit und loggt sich "
"mit diesem Character ein."

#: checks.py:98
msgid "Tick Character Audit in CharLink and log in with this character."
msgstr ""
"Setze in CharLink den Haken bei Character Audit und logge dich mit diesem "
"Character ein."

#: checks.py:99
msgid "Add this character in the corptools Character Audit."
msgstr "Füge diesen Character im corptools-Character-Audit hinzu."

#: checks.py:105
msgid "Scopes missing"
msgstr "Scopes fehlen"

#: checks.py:106
msgid "None of the character's tokens carries all scopes corptools asks for."
msgstr ""
"Keiner der Tokens des Characters trägt alle Scopes, die corptools verlangt."

#: checks.py:108
msgid ""
"The player adds this character in the corptools Character Audit again and "
"grants every scope it asks for."
msgstr ""
"Der Spieler fügt diesen Character im corptools-Character-Audit erneut hinzu "
"und erteilt alle verlangten Scopes."

#: checks.py:113
msgid ""
"The player ticks Character Audit in CharLink, logs in with this character "
"again and grants every scope it asks for."
msgstr ""
"Der Spieler setzt in CharLink den Haken bei Character Audit, loggt sich "
"erneut mit diesem Character ein und erteilt alle verlangten Scopes."

#: checks.py:117
msgid ""
"Tick Character Audit in CharLink, log in with this character again and grant"
" every scope it asks for."
msgstr ""
"Setze in CharLink den Haken bei Character Audit, logge dich erneut mit "
"diesem Character ein und erteile alle verlangten Scopes."

#: checks.py:121
msgid ""
"Add this character in the corptools Character Audit again and grant every "
"scope it asks for."
msgstr ""
"Füge diesen Character im corptools-Character-Audit erneut hinzu und erteile "
"alle verlangten Scopes."

#: checks.py:129
msgid "Audit inactive"
msgstr "Audit inaktiv"

#: checks.py:130
msgid ""
"corptools marks the audit inactive: a section has not updated for too long."
msgstr ""
"corptools markiert das Audit als inaktiv: Ein Abschnitt wurde zu lange nicht"
" aktualisiert."

#: checks.py:131
msgid ""
"The next corptools update usually clears this; if it stays, the player adds "
"the character again."
msgstr ""
"Meist behebt das die nächste corptools-Aktualisierung; bleibt es, fügt der "
"Spieler den Character erneut hinzu."

#: checks.py:134
msgid ""
"The next corptools update usually clears this; if it stays, the player ticks"
" Character Audit in CharLink and logs in with this character again."
msgstr ""
"Meist behebt das die nächste corptools-Aktualisierung; bleibt es, setzt der "
"Spieler in CharLink den Haken bei Character Audit und loggt sich erneut mit "
"diesem Character ein."

#: checks.py:138
msgid ""
"The next corptools update usually clears this; if it stays, tick Character "
"Audit in CharLink and log in with this character again."
msgstr ""
"Meist behebt das die nächste corptools-Aktualisierung; bleibt es, setze in "
"CharLink den Haken bei Character Audit und logge dich erneut mit diesem "
"Character ein."

#: checks.py:141
msgid ""
"The next corptools update usually clears this; if it stays, add the "
"character again."
msgstr ""
"Meist behebt das die nächste corptools-Aktualisierung; bleibt es, füge den "
"Character erneut hinzu."

#: checks.py:147
msgid "Director token missing"
msgstr "Director-Token fehlt"

#: checks.py:149
msgid ""
"The character is a Director of its Corporation, but none of its tokens "
"carries all scopes corptools needs for the Corporation audit."
msgstr ""
"Der Character ist Director seiner Corporation, aber keiner seiner Tokens "
"trägt alle Scopes, die corptools für das Corporation-Audit braucht."

#: checks.py:152
msgid ""
"The Director adds a Corporation token in the corptools Corporation Audit."
msgstr ""
"Der Director fügt im corptools-Corporation-Audit einen Corporation-Token "
"hinzu."

#: checks.py:154
msgid ""
"The Director ticks Corporation Audit in CharLink and logs in with this "
"character."
msgstr ""
"Der Director setzt in CharLink den Haken bei Corporation Audit und loggt "
"sich mit diesem Character ein."

#: checks.py:155
msgid "Tick Corporation Audit in CharLink and log in with this character."
msgstr ""
"Setze in CharLink den Haken bei Corporation Audit und logge dich mit diesem "
"Character ein."

#: checks.py:156
msgid ""
"Add a Corporation token in the corptools Corporation Audit with this "
"character."
msgstr ""
"Füge mit diesem Character im corptools-Corporation-Audit einen Corporation-"
"Token hinzu."

#: checks.py:163
msgid "Corporation audit missing"
msgstr "Corporation-Audit fehlt"

#: checks.py:164
msgid "The Corporation has no corptools Corporation Audit."
msgstr "Die Corporation hat kein corptools-Corporation-Audit."

#: checks.py:165
msgid "A Director adds the Corporation in the corptools Corporation Audit."
msgstr ""
"Ein Director fügt die Corporation im corptools-Corporation-Audit hinzu."

#: checks.py:167 checks.py:177
msgid ""
"A Director ticks Corporation Audit in CharLink and logs in with the Director"
" character."
msgstr ""
"Ein Director setzt in CharLink den Haken bei Corporation Audit und loggt "
"sich mit dem Director-Character ein."

#: checks.py:173
msgid "Corporation token missing"
msgstr "Corporation-Token fehlt"

#: checks.py:174
msgid ""
"No character of the Corporation has a token with the scopes the Corporation "
"audit needs."
msgstr ""
"Kein Character der Corporation hat einen Token mit den Scopes, die das "
"Corporation-Audit braucht."

#: checks.py:175
msgid ""
"A Director adds a Corporation token in the corptools Corporation Audit."
msgstr ""
"Ein Director fügt im corptools-Corporation-Audit einen Corporation-Token "
"hinzu."

#: checks.py:183
msgid "Corporation data stale"
msgstr "Corporation-Daten veraltet"

#: checks.py:184
msgid "A section of the Corporation audit has not updated within the limit."
msgstr ""
"Ein Abschnitt des Corporation-Audits wurde nicht innerhalb der Frist "
"aktualisiert."

#: checks.py:186
msgid ""
"A Director checks the Corporation token in the corptools Corporation Audit "
"and adds a new one if it lost its roles."
msgstr ""
"Ein Director prüft den Corporation-Token im corptools-Corporation-Audit und "
"fügt einen neuen hinzu, falls er seine Rollen verloren hat."

#: checks.py:191
msgid ""
"A Director ticks Corporation Audit in CharLink and logs in again with the "
"Director character; the old token may have lost its roles."
msgstr ""
"Ein Director setzt in CharLink den Haken bei Corporation Audit und loggt "
"sich erneut mit dem Director-Character ein; der alte Token hat womöglich "
"seine Rollen verloren."

#: checks.py:199
msgid "No structure owner"
msgstr "Kein Structure-Owner"

#: checks.py:200
msgid "The Corporation is not set up as an owner in aa-structures."
msgstr "Die Corporation ist in aa-structures nicht als Owner eingerichtet."

#: checks.py:201
msgid ""
"A character with the Station Manager role adds the Corporation as an owner "
"in aa-structures."
msgstr ""
"Ein Character mit der Rolle Station Manager fügt die Corporation in aa-"
"structures als Owner hinzu."

#: checks.py:203 checks.py:221
msgid ""
"A character with the Station Manager role ticks Structures in CharLink and "
"logs in."
msgstr ""
"Ein Character mit der Rolle Station Manager setzt in CharLink den Haken bei "
"Structures und loggt sich ein."

#: checks.py:209
msgid "Structure owner inactive"
msgstr "Structure-Owner inaktiv"

#: checks.py:210
msgid "The aa-structures owner of the Corporation is switched off."
msgstr "Der aa-structures-Owner der Corporation ist ausgeschaltet."

#: checks.py:211
msgid "An admin switches the owner on again in the aa-structures admin."
msgstr ""
"Ein Admin schaltet den Owner in der aa-structures-Verwaltung wieder ein."

#: checks.py:217
msgid "No structure owner character"
msgstr "Kein Structure-Owner-Character"

#: checks.py:218
msgid ""
"The aa-structures owner has no enabled character left to fetch data with."
msgstr ""
"Dem aa-structures-Owner ist kein aktivierter Character mehr geblieben, mit "
"dem Daten abgerufen werden können."

#: checks.py:219
msgid ""
"A character with the Station Manager role adds itself to the owner in aa-"
"structures."
msgstr ""
"Ein Character mit der Rolle Station Manager fügt sich in aa-structures dem "
"Owner hinzu."

#: checks.py:227
msgid "Structure sync failing"
msgstr "Structure-Sync schlägt fehl"

#: checks.py:228
msgid "aa-structures reports a sync that is not up to date."
msgstr "aa-structures meldet einen Sync, der nicht aktuell ist."

#: checks.py:229
msgid ""
"Check the owner in aa-structures: its characters may have lost the Station "
"Manager role."
msgstr ""
"Den Owner in aa-structures prüfen: Seine Characters haben womöglich die "
"Rolle Station Manager verloren."

#: checks.py:232
msgid ""
"A character with the Station Manager role ticks Structures in CharLink and "
"logs in again; the owner's characters may have lost the role."
msgstr ""
"Ein Character mit der Rolle Station Manager setzt in CharLink den Haken bei "
"Structures und loggt sich erneut ein; die Characters des Owners haben "
"womöglich die Rolle verloren."

